  },
  {
    "id": 1011001000610010,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ああ、音楽じゃなくて英語のリスニングだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101100100061/1011001000610010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001000610020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "最近、仕事が忙しくなってきただろ？\r\nあまり勉強時間が取れなくなってきたんだよなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101100100061/1011001000610020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たしかに仕事が増えると勉強が大変になるよな……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "俺が教えようか？",
    "nextLabel": "1011001000611"
  },
  {
    "select": "いつも勉強は\r\n欠かさないのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1011001000612"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "テスト前の日程、\r\n調整しようか？",
    "nextLabel": "1011001000613"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001000610030,
    "label": "1011001000611",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "教えるって、プロデューサー勉強できるのか？\r\n期待はしてねーけど、試しにお願いしてみようかな",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101100100061/1011001000610030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001000610040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "へへ、アタシのことガッカリさせんなよ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101100100061/1011001000610040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001000610050,
    "label": "1011001000612",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "まぁ、欠かさねーっていうか、ほどほどだよ\r\nしない理由も特になかったし",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101100100061/1011001000610050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001000610060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "それにアイドル始めたからって、\r\n成績落ちるのもかっこわりーからな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101100100061/1011001000610060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001000610070,
    "label": "1011001000613",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "いや、調整なんていいって\r\nアタシの都合で仕事とかを動かすわけにはいかねーしな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101100100061/1011001000610070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001000610080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "これくらいアタシの力で乗り越えてみせるさ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101100100061/1011001000610080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うっ……しまった。別のことを言えば良かったな……）",
